  analysis (k, l+1 dimensions), making it ALREADY the SelfTargetMSIS estimate.

SelfTargetMSIS vs MSIS hardness (from KN-LIT-056):
  Section 4.2: "there is a (non-tight) reduction from MSIS to SelfTargetMSIS"
  --> SelfTargetMSIS is AT LEAST AS HARD as MSIS
